# PDP share thumbnails

- Every current and future PDP uses its first gallery image (`product.imageSrc`) as the sole photo source for Open Graph and Twitter share thumbnails.
- Reuse `productShareImagePath` for metadata and `scripts/generate-social-images.mjs` for generated assets. Never maintain separate per-product thumbnail version overrides.
- Generate product share images before local dev and production builds. When changing a cover, use a new versioned image path so the share URL changes too.
- Preserve the full photograph and proportions with contain sizing. Do not substitute another gallery photo, supplier swatch, or collage.
- Verify all listed products have a generated thumbnail matching their current cover path, and check both Open Graph and Twitter metadata.
- Work locally only. Thumbnail updates never authorize deployment; Diana deploys manually.
